.TH QUIPU-AUDIT-TREE 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-audit\-tree \- Reassemble the dispatch forest from a trace\*(Aqs principal chains
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu audit tree\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fItrace.jsonl\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Reassemble the dispatch forest from a trace\*(Aqs principal chains
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print machine\-readable JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fItrace.jsonl\fR>

